1
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,670
One morning, Sokha is riding to work as usual.

2
00:00:05,670 --> 00:00:09,340
Suddenly — bang! A tire bursts in the middle of the road.

3
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:14,180
There is no repair shop anywhere around, and Sokha doesn't know what to do.

4
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:21,450
But then Sokha remembers the HRC app. Sokha opens the phone and taps "Help me".

5
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:25,380
In just a few minutes, the nearest mechanic arrives.

6
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:28,860
Fixed, with a clear price and an easy payment.

7
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:34,760
Sokha rides on safely. Help Road Cambodia — roadside help, any time, anywhere.
